      "unitRules": [
        {
          "name": "Wraith-construct",
          "text": "A wraithbone shell animated by the spirit of a dead Aeldari, painted in the colours of the masque it marches with. A Model with this Special Rule is not affected by the Fear (X) Special Rule and never gains the Pinned or Routed Tactical Status."
        },
        {
          "name": "Wraithsight",
          "text": "The spirit within sees the battlefield only dimly without a psyker to guide it. At the start of its Controlling Player's turn, unless a Model with this Special Rule is within 12\" of a friendly Model with the Psyker Trait (such as a Shadowseer), roll a Dice. On a result of 1, it gains the Stunned Tactical Status."
        }
